Package: libdannan0.5
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: network layer for a cluster of trusted machines
 Dannan makes a set of nodes, on any mix of home hardware and rented cloud
 and behind any NAT, behave as one network that the systems hosted on them
 can transmit over: the virtual PHY and MAC. It carries frames between nodes
 and knows who the nodes are, and it stores nothing.
 .
 This package holds the shared library. Patch releases of one minor keep its
 ABI, so the package is named for major.minor.

Package: libdannan-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libdevel
Depends:
 libdannan0.5 (= ${binary:Version}),
 libboost-dev (>= 1.83),
 libssl-dev,
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: network layer for a cluster of trusted machines (development files)
 Dannan makes a set of nodes, on any mix of home hardware and rented cloud
 and behind any NAT, behave as one network that the systems hosted on them
 can transmit over.
 .
 This package holds the headers and the CMake package configuration:
 find_package(dannan <version> CONFIG), then link dannan::dannan.

Package: dannan-tools
Architecture: any
Section: net
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: network layer for a cluster of trusted machines (operator tools)
 Dannan makes a set of nodes, on any mix of home hardware and rented cloud
 and behind any NAT, behave as one network that the systems hosted on them
 can transmit over.
 .
 This package holds dannan-ca, the cluster's certificate authority;
 dannan-import-macha, which turns Macha's state files into Dannan's once at
 the first cutover; and dannan-version.
